messages = Array[String](["Your swing goes wide. The air remains undefeated.", "You misjudge the distance and connect with a whole lot of nothing.", "A clumsy miss. Somewhere, a weaponsmith you'll never meet sighs.", "It slips in your grip and the blow lands nowhere useful.", "Close! But 'close' doesn't leave a mark."])
